                    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
                    "body": "Yes it work. \r\nThanks you so much. I facing another issue. \r\nIt seems i can't make `mini.icons` work with `mini.autocompletion`.\r\n \r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a25aca67-4336-4157-b1e7-0a6a5682fb19)\r\n\r\nThis is how i setup my mini.icons\r\n```lua\r\nreturn { 'echasnovski/mini.icons', version = false,\r\n\tconfig = function()\r\n\trequire(\"mini.icons\").setup()\r\n\tend\r\n}\r\n```\r\nMy setup in completion. I expected show icons.\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nreturn { \r\n\t'echasnovski/mini.completion', version = false,\r\n\tdependencies = {'echasnovski/mini.icons'},\r\nconfig = function()\r\n\trequire(\"mini.completion\").setup()\r\n\tend\r\n\r\n}\r\n\r\n```\r\n@echasnovski ",
