                    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
                    "body": "I really hope the mini.autocompletion can finally support snippet in future. \r\nIt only work with lsp now. I tried mini.snippet today but it seems it not working. And turn out i read the docs of `mini.completion` and realize this plugins is not expand snippets..\r\n",
                    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">I really hope the mini.autocompletion can finally support snippet in future.<br>\nIt only work with lsp now. I tried mini.snippet today but it seems it not working. And turn out i read the docs of <code class=\"notranslate\">mini.completion</code> and realize this plugins is not expand snippets..</p>",
