                {
                    "author": {
                        "avatarUrl": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24854248?u=d09fd974c6720eba3039db6beb2f1c1efecdb51d&v=4",
                        "login": "echasnovski",
                        "resourcePath": "/echasnovski",
                        "url": "https://github.com/echasnovski"
                    },
                    "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
                    "body": "> I tried mini.snippet today but it seems it not working.\r\n\r\n'mini.snippets' does work as it is designed to not depend on completion engines to provide snippets.\r\n\r\nAdding snippet support in 'mini.completion' has very high priority during current phase of backlog cleaning. You can subscribe to #886 to keep track.",
                    "bodyHTML": "<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I tried mini.snippet today but it seems it not working.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">'mini.snippets' does work as it is designed to not depend on completion engines to provide snippets.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Adding snippet support in 'mini.completion' has very high priority during current phase of backlog cleaning. You can subscribe to <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2302854262\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/886\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/886/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/886\">#886</a> to keep track.</p>",
                    "bodyText": "I tried mini.snippet today but it seems it not working.\n\n'mini.snippets' does work as it is designed to not depend on completion engines to provide snippets.\nAdding snippet support in 'mini.completion' has very high priority during current phase of backlog cleaning. You can subscribe to #886 to keep track.",
